# End-to-End Testing

Purpose:
  End-to-End Testing

Skill: End-to-End Testing

ID:
  SKILL-CROSS-TEST-E2E

Domain:
  cross-cutting/testing

Use:
  testing complete user workflows

Apply:
  intermediate
  senior
  end-to-end
  user-acceptance

