TechnologyLifecycle:
  Current: MATURE

HumanDoc:
  docs/skills/cross-cutting/testing/e2e.md

Evidence:
  - Playwright Documentation
  - Cypress Documentation
  - Production experience

Rules:
  [E1] Test critical user journeys.
  [E2] Use Page Object Model for maintainability.
  [E3] Use data-testid for element selection.
  [E4] Use environment variables for test data.
  [E5] Run E2E tests in CI/CD after deployment.
  [E6] Use visual regression testing for UI.
  [E7] Parallelize tests for speed.
  [E8] Use video recording for debugging failures.

Pros:
  - High confidence
  - Catches UI/UX issues
  - User perspective

Cons:
  - Slow execution
  - Flaky tests
  - Maintenance cost

Alternatives:
  - Integration testing
  - Contract testing
  - Manual testing

State: +

